    <!-- Green Screen: an old phosphor terminal, built on the Default theme (parentScreenThemeId; docs/ui/Qvt-Client.md, Themes), so the
         shell values the apps seed on DEFAULT_QUASAR (tray screens, counts, hooks, logo) are its own too. It sets only what it changes:
